  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:10 P.M.    天氣/晴\n企鵝物流據點，糟糕的室內"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "這裡就是企鵝物流的據點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（好亂，而且好暗。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "只是我們的據點之一，沒怎麼好好收拾，隨意坐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "啊，謝謝......我好像還沒有正式向你們道謝，企鵝物流的各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "只是工作，先做個自我介紹好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——信使，代號拜松，來自龍門峯馳物流，受家父指教，前來貴司參觀學習，請多關照。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "關於我與大帝先生的合約內容，雖然之前已經確認過了，但還是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "慢著，我有個小問題，你那人高馬大的爹是怎麼把你養得這麼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "......老闆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "好，好，你繼續。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "咳，關於剛才的襲擊，無疑是對峯馳物流和企鵝物流的挑釁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "這件事情絕不能輕視，如果有必要的話，我會通知家父和近衛局，此事應當被視作一起惡性襲擊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "喂，德克薩斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "晚上吃什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "歡迎派對！還用問嗎？但是空去哪兒了，不是留下看家了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "反正只要德克薩斯聯繫她的話，她立刻就能趕回來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "啊，抱歉，你接著說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（空？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......咳，當務之急是調查那些襲擊我們的敵人，企鵝物流的各位有什麼頭緒嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "頭緒？不就是普通的業務糾紛嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃，業務糾紛......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "德克薩斯！我抽屜裡的雪茄呢！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "老闆，我們已經好久沒回過這個據點了，恐怕早就發霉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "空來打掃過，可能那時候扔掉了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊，那我今天晚上會死的，不行，這可不行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊，你繼續，別在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "首先我們應該明確敵人的目的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "慢著，音樂！我的黑膠唱片！是不是放了一箱在這裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "啊，好像是我搬來的。那一箱得有我好幾個月薪水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "在這兒，要聽哪張？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "隨便哪張都行，被我選中的只會是宇宙末日級精品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "啊，音樂，有了藝術的人生才不會無聊，讚美音樂，以及我自己！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "拜松，接著說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......我、我說到哪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "他們的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "對！他們的目的應該是我，也許，是為了挑撥貴司與我司的關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "什麼啊，這點小事，還以為只是給之前的事情報仇......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "您有什麼線索嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "——咳咳！德克薩斯！去調查一下他們！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "加班費，三倍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "唔，這種程度的打架每個月都會有個十七八次啦。信使不都是這樣工作的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "信使不是應該更加隱密一點，迅速一點......從來不是以武力為標準的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "是這樣的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "......我們明明是個物流公司，為什麼總是被捲進幫派鬥爭裡去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "因為他們的品味太低，對自己生而為人的品味太低。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "也因為老闆發我們薪水嘛。不過還是有在遵紀守法地運送貨物啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "只是大部分時候都會變成武裝運送而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "對嘛，這有什麼問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......？這真的沒問題嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "先等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "這裡，是空留下的密碼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "餅、餅乾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，幹嘛要打開了放在這裡，受潮了就不好吃了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "有巧克力的一面是長，尾巴是短，這是密碼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "（這是什麼獨特的密碼學......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "什麼？那時候是當真的嗎？不是玩笑？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "......我只是普通地記下了空的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "“可疑分子”，唔，空可能追出去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "隨她去吧，已經到下班時間了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "今天可是安魂夜，沒有加班，沒有資本主義的壓迫，否則死人都難安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "晚上誰想去喝一杯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "啊，莫非老闆請客？上次才進了一批價格不菲的藏酒~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "完全沒問題，反正你們幾個有大把的薪水可以扣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "那算了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "等等！那個......我們沒有什麼對策嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "不需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "就放任這些黑手黨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "走一步看一步囉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......龍門近衛局不會介入嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "大概不會吧 ，他們應該都習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "既來之則安之。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "但上個月的公物損害賠償清單有點多，大夥各自都稍微注意一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......那，平時的工作呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "按照委託送貨，然後打架。如果要打架的話，打架優先。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "順便一提，任何委託只過老闆一手，至於誰來做，誰能搶到就算誰的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "喂，叫拜松的小子，你爹把你託付給我們，哪怕只是暫時的，你也是企鵝物流的一員了，明白嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——明白，呃，大概吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "那麼你就必須記住，企鵝物流員工須知的第一條重要規定，那就是：“不拘小節”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "昨天不還是“娛樂至死”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "我記得是“及時行樂”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "......差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "想要綁架你這樣的公子哥的罪犯不在少數，按我們的規矩，來一個打一個，就這麼簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "——等等，怎麼感覺屁股怪怪的，我完美的人體工程學沙發椅下是不是有什麼東西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嗯？我看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，好可愛的糖果盒，老闆，你竟然在椅子下面偷藏零食！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "胡說，我怎麼會蠢到把零食藏在這種——糖果盒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "就是糖果盒啊，上面還寫著“維多利亞水果軟糖”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "離遠點能天使，那大概是個陷阱，別打開——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "唉，趴下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
